f(6,'explanation','Correct as a general Linux filesystem portability concern: file fsync does not by itself guarantee persistence of the parent directory entry. Directory synchronization support and semantics must be checked.','POSIXdoesnotuniversallyrequiredirectoryfsync.',fs,o=2)
